*20
/AUTOCOR
/AUTOCORRELOGRAM FOR 512 DATA POINTS, 127 LAGS
/DATA IS SAMPLED & DISPLAYED
/CORRELOGRAMS ARE DISPLAYED
/THEN STORED ON UNIT 1
/RSW GIVE BN IN WHICH FIRST CORRELOGRAM IS STORED
/COMPUTATION IS FROM COAUTO BY A.J.HANCE
/THIS REVISION BY D.A.OVERTON, 11/25/69
/
/FIRST LETS DEFINE CLOCK INSTS.
CLSK=6131
CLLR=6132
CLAB=6133
CLEN=6134
CLSA=6135
CLBA=6136
CLCA=6137
/
/NEXT DEFINE SAMPLING RATES
PMODE
DECIMAL
/DISSET = NO. OF 100 USEC EPOCHS PER SAMPLE 
	/FOR THE OSCILLOSCOPE MODE
DISSET=-20	/500 CPS
/SAMSET = NO OF 10 USEC EPOCHS PER SAMPLE FOR DATA ENTRY
SAMSET=-500	/200 CPS
LMODE
OCTAL
