	CLLR
	LINC
	LMODE
	JMP SD5
K3100,	3100
K0300,	0300
K3,	DISSET
K0100,	0100
/DISPLAY CH 10
SD5,	SET I 2	/X COORD
	777
SD1, IOB
CLSK
JMP .+2
JMP SD4
SAM 10
SCR 1
DIS 2
JMP SD1
SD4,	IOB
CLSA	/CLEAR FLAG
SAM 10
SCR 1	/SO DATA WILL FIT ON SCOPE
DIS I 2
SNS I 5
JMP SD2	/GO TO COREAD
SNS I 3
JMP SD3
SNS 0
JMP SD1	/DISPLAY INPUT AGAIN
/STOP CLOCK
CLR
IOB
CLLR
IOB
CLEN
JMP SAMP	/IF SS0=1
